{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":114,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರ ರಕ್ಷಕನ ಮಹತ್ವ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರು ಐಗುಪ್ತ ದೇಶವನ್ನೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯಾಕೋಬನ ಮನೆತನದವರು ಅನ್ಯಜನಾಂಗವನ್ನು ಬಿಟ್ಟ ಮೇಲೆ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೂದವು ದೇವರ ಪರಿಶುದ್ಧ ವಾಸಸ್ಥಾನವೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲ್ ಆತನ ರಾಜ್ಯವೂ ಆಯಿತು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಸಮುದ್ರವು ಕಂಡು ಓಡಿಹೋಯಿತು;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೊರ್ದನ್ ಹೊಳೆಯು ಹಿಂದಿರುಗಿತು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪರ್ವತಗಳು ಟಗರುಗಳಂತೆಯೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಗುಡ್ಡಗಳು ಕುರಿಮರಿಗಳಂತೆಯೂ ಹಾರಾಡಿದವು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಸಮುದ್ರವೇ, ನಿನಗೇನಾಯಿತು? ಏಕೆ ಓಡಿ ಹೋಗುತ್ತೀ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೊರ್ದನೇ, ಏಕೆ ಹಿಂದಿರುಗುತ್ತೀ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪರ್ವತಗಳೇ, ನೀವು ಟಗರುಗಳಂತೆಯೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಗುಡ್ಡಗಳೇ, ನೀವು ಕುರಿಮರಿಗಳಂತೆಯೂ ಏಕೆ ಹಾರಾಡುತ್ತೀರಿ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಭೂಲೋಕವೇ, ಕರ್ತನು ಪ್ರತ್ಯಕ್ಷನಾಗಿದ್ದಾನೆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯಾಕೋಬನ ದೇವರು ನಿನ್ನ ಮುಂದೆ ಇದ್ದಾನೆ, ಕಂಪಿಸು.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನು ಬಂಡೆಯನ್ನು ಕೆರೆಯನ್ನಾಗಿಯೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಶಿಲೆಯನ್ನು ಬುಗ್ಗೆಯನ್ನಾಗಿಯೂ ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}